# Claude Code - Skills Shared Environment Variables
# Location: .claude/skills/.env   (copy this template and fill in values)
# Scope: shared across all skills
#
# Resolution order (highest priority first) — a more specific .env wins:
#   process.env -> <skill>/.env -> .claude/skills/.env (this file) -> .claude/.env -> ~/.claude/.env

# ============================================
# Google Gemini API (research, scout, repomix, and other Gemini-CLI paths)
# ============================================
# Get from: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
